<rml>
<head>
	<!-- The damage count window (uidamagecount.py DamageCountWindow,
	     uiscript damagecount.py; NOVA-27, OLD uiDamageCount.py,
	     __BOSS_DAMAGE_COUNT__): the top 10 attackers of a damage-count world
	     boss, highest first, with each one's damage and share, a bar against
	     the leader in the row's color, the player's own row framed, and the
	     boss's name and HP above. While the damage-count flag is on (the hud
	     group), the Interface makes nui_damage_count.DamageCountWindow
	     (controller assets/root/nui_damage_count.py), a subclass of the
	     legacy class on proxies: the ranking, the shares, the HP colors and
	     the rules that open and close it are legacy's code. An updated row's
	     damage turns from grey to the text color in 0.1s (flash 1 and 2 run
	     the same keyframes, so each update starts them again), with no
	     Python per frame. The title row moves the window; its close button
	     closes it (close_press); a press anywhere raises it (board_press).
	     Legacy's 392dp board, its gauge and texts at their places, the rows
	     25dp tall from 60dp down. The document exists only while the window
	     shows (nui_hud.OnDemand) and draws below the legacy UI layer. -->
	<title>damage-count</title>
	<link type="text/template" href="../../nui.rtpl"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="damage-count.rcss"/>
</head>
<body template="nui" id="damage-count" class="nui-window nui-fx nui-anim nui-below-legacy-ui damage-count"
      data-model="damage_count" data-event-mousedown="board_press(ev.button)">
	<handle class="damage-count__handle" move_target="#document">
		<span class="damage-count__target">{{ target }}</span>
		<div class="damage-count__hp">
			<span class="damage-count__hp-text">{{ hp_text }}</span>
			<progress class="nui-gauge damage-count__gauge" direction="right" data-attr-value="hp_value"/>
			<span class="damage-count__hp-percent" data-class-is-high="hp_tone == 'high'"
			      data-class-is-mid="hp_tone == 'mid'" data-class-is-low="hp_tone == 'low'">{{ hp_percent }}</span>
		</div>
	</handle>
	<button id="damage-count-close" class="nui-button nui-button--ghost nui-button--icon-sm nui-anim damage-count__close"
	        data-event-mousedown="close_press(ev.button)"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--close"><span
		class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></button>
	<div id="damage-count-list" class="damage-count__list">
		<div class="damage-count__slot" data-for="r : rows">
			<div class="damage-count__row" data-attr-id="'damage-count-row-' + it_index"
			     data-class-is-own="r.own" data-class-damage-count__row--c0="r.color == 0" data-class-damage-count__row--c1="r.color == 1" data-class-damage-count__row--c2="r.color == 2" data-class-damage-count__row--c3="r.color == 3"
			     data-class-damage-count__row--c4="r.color == 4" data-class-damage-count__row--c5="r.color == 5" data-class-damage-count__row--c6="r.color == 6" data-class-damage-count__row--c7="r.color == 7"
			     data-style---damage-count-bar="r.width + 'dp'">
				<span class="damage-count__bar"></span>
				<span class="damage-count__frame"></span>
				<span class="damage-count__no">{{ r.no }}</span>
				<img class="damage-count__face" data-if="r.face != ''" data-attr-src="r.face"/>
				<span class="damage-count__name">{{ r.name }}</span>
				<span class="damage-count__damage nui-anim" data-class-is-flash-a="r.flash == 1"
				      data-class-is-flash-b="r.flash == 2">{{ r.damage }}</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
